---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Donkey Kong Bananza — Switch 2 Exclusive Buying Guide"
  description="Donkey Kong Bananza buying guide: what it is, who it's for, and where to buy the digital version cheapest on Switch 2."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Donkey Kong Bananza — Switch 2 Exclusive Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">Nintendo Switch 2 · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Donkey Kong Bananza</strong> is a fresh 3D platformer exclusive to the
      Nintendo Switch 2, putting DK's smashing power at the center of a destructible,
      underground adventure.
    </p>

    <h2>What makes it different</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Destruction-focused gameplay</strong> — punch through terrain to find secrets</li>
      <li><strong>Family-friendly platforming</strong> — accessible but with depth for completionists</li>
      <li><strong>Switch 2 showcase</strong> — built to show off the new hardware</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Digital vs physical</h2>
    <p>
      As a new Switch 2 exclusive, Bananza launches at list price and the first real
      discounts usually appear later in the year as holiday bundles. The digital version
      is the most convenient if you want to play on day one without hunting for a
      cartridge.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Donkey+Kong+Bananza+Switch+2"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
